        "de": [
          "Im Royal St martin\nEröffnung am Samstag, den 6. März ab 11:30 Uhr\n207 route de saint-omer\n09 53 49 92 43\nAuch über Uber Eats erhältlich\nKebab, Burger und Tacos."
        ],
        "en": [
          "At the Royal St martin\nOpening on Saturday, March 6 from 11:30 am\n207 route de saint-omer\n09 53 49 92 43\nAlso available on Uber Eats\nKebabs, burgers and tacos."
        ],
        "it": [
          "Al Royal St martin\nApertura sabato 6 marzo dalle 11.30\n207 route de saint-omer\n09 53 49 92 43\nDisponibile anche su Uber Eats\nKebab, hamburger e tacos."
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Au Royal St martin \nOuverture le samedi 6 mars dès 11h30\n207 route de saint-omer\n09 53 49 92 43\nDisponible également sur Uber Eats\nKebabs, burgers et tacos."
